            <note corresp="#d463-f1" n="13" xml:id="d463-f1-content">
                <p>For a brief description of Allied military assistance to the Slovak uprising, see
                    Jozef Lettrich, <hi rendition="#italic">History of Modern Slovakia</hi>
                    (Frederick A. Praeger, New York, 1955), p. 213.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d463-f2" n="14" xml:id="d463-f2-content">
                <p>Type of small, automatic rifle.</p>
            </note>
